None of the copyleft components is linked into this repository's own binaries;
they run as separate processes or containers. That separation is what keeps the
combination distributable, so it is a constraint on how this project may be
integrated rather than a footnote. See docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for
per-dependency detail, including the npm packages.

This repository re-distributes cryptographic implementations. Users must
verify their jurisdiction's export-control regulations (e.g. US ECCN 5D002)
before public deployment.
